# ── beehiiv excerpt (build ignores this; use it when composing the newsletter LAST) ──
# "Banks share enormously — 130 million connections and climbing. What they don't share is a right.
#  Consent looks like a switch to the person clicking it; what it actually reaches is a negotiated
#  position between two companies. And §1033, the rule that would have set an outer limit, never
#  covered brokerage, retirement or mortgages in the first place."

